        <unique>true</unique>
    </fields>
    <fields>
        <fullName>c2g__PostingAllowed__c</fullName>
        <deprecated>false</deprecated>
        <description>By default, this field is set to “All Dates” which allows this dimension to be assigned to any document irrespective of its period. You can set it to “Select Dates” and specify the dates in the Date From and Date To fields. This makes the dimension available for posting only those documents that have the period start and end dates within the dates mentioned here.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>The “All Dates” option allows you to associate this dimension with documents assigned to any period. The “Select Dates” option allows you to specify the dates in the Date From and Date To fields. This makes the dimension available for posting only those documents that have the period start and end dates within the dates mentioned here.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Allow Posting</label>
        <required>false</required>
        <trackHistory>false</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>Picklist</type>
        <valueSet>
            <restricted>true</restricted>
            <valueSetDefinition>
                <sorted>false</sorted>
                <value>
                    <fullName>All Dates</fullName>
                    <default>true</default>
                    <label>All Dates</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Select Dates</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Select Dates</label>
                </value>
            </valueSetDefinition>
        </valueSet>
    </fields>
